---
import logo from '../assets/logo.svg';
import github from '../assets/social/github.svg';
import discord from '../assets/social/discord.svg';
import instagram from '../assets/social/instagram.svg';
import globe from '../assets/social/globe.svg';

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="footer-main">
			<div class="footer-brand">
				<a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="DevLearn - página inicial">
					<img src={logo.src} width="42" height="42" alt="" />
					<span>Dev<br />Learn</span>
				</a>
				<p>Aprenda, pratique e construa seu próximo projeto com o DevLearn.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="footer-column">
				<h2>Explore</h2>
				<a href="/">Início</a>
				<a href="/conteudos">Conteúdos</a>
				<a href="/projetos">Projetos</a>
			</div>

			<div class="footer-column">
				<h2>DevLearn</h2>
				<a href="/sobre">Sobre nós</a>
				<a href="/contato">Contato</a>
				<a href="/contato">Contribua</a>
			</div>

			<div class="footer-community">
				<h2>Faça parte</h2>
				<p>Toda e qualquer contribuição será bem-vinda.</p>
				<div class="social-links" aria-label="Redes sociais">
					<a href="#" aria-label="GitHub"><img src={github.src} width="20" height="20" alt="" /></a>
					<a href="#" aria-label="Discord"><img src={discord.src} width="20" height="20" alt="" /></a>
					<a href="#" aria-label="Instagram"><img src={instagram.src} width="20" height="20" alt="" /></a>
					<a href="#" aria-label="Site"><img src={globe.src} width="20" height="20" alt="" /></a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="footer-bottom">
			<p class="copy">© {currentYear} DevLearn. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
			<p class="made-with">Feito para quem aprende fazendo.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>

<style>
	.site-footer {
		margin-top: 48px;
		padding: 56px 0 24px;
		border-top: 1px solid rgb(192 132 252 / 16%);
		background: rgb(7 10 30 / 72%);
	}

	.footer-main {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, 1.7fr) repeat(2, minmax(110px, 0.8fr)) minmax(180px, 1.2fr);
		gap: 38px;
		padding-bottom: 42px;
	}

	.footer-brand .brand {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.1;
	}

	.footer-brand .brand img {
		width: 42px;
		height: 42px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgb(155 80 255 / 38%);
	}

	.footer-brand > p {
		max-width: 20rem;
		margin: 18px 0 0;
		color: #a9abc2;
		font-size: 0.86rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
	}

	.footer-column,
	.footer-community {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: flex-start;
	}

	.footer-column h2,
	.footer-community h2 {
		margin: 4px 0 16px;
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.footer-column a {
		margin-bottom: 9px;
		color: #a9abc2;
		font-size: 0.86rem;
		transition: color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
	}

	.footer-column a:hover {
		color: #ff75b7;
		transform: translateX(3px);
	}

	.footer-community > p {
		max-width: 14rem;
		margin: 0;
		color: #a9abc2;
		font-size: 0.86rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	.social-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 10px;
		margin-top: 18px;
	}

	.social-links a {
		display: grid;
		place-items: center;
		width: 34px;
		height: 34px;
		border: 1px solid rgb(255 79 163 / 28%);
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: rgb(255 255 255 / 5%);
		transition: border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
	}

	.social-links a:hover {
		border-color: #ff75b7;
		background: rgb(255 79 163 / 16%);
		transform: translateY(-3px);
	}

	.social-links img {
		width: 18px;
		height: 18px;
		filter: invert(74%) sepia(31%) saturate(1200%) hue-rotate(285deg) brightness(105%);
	}

	.footer-bottom {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 20px;
		padding-top: 20px;
		border-top: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 8%);
	}

	.copy,
	.made-with {
		margin: 0;
		color: #777a98;
		font-size: 0.76rem;
	}

	.made-with {
		color: #9a9bb0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 800px) {
		.footer-main {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
			gap: 32px 24px;
		}

		.footer-brand,
		.footer-community {
			grid-column: 1 / -1;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 520px) {
		.site-footer {
			padding-top: 42px;
		}

		.footer-main {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		}

		.footer-bottom {
			align-items: flex-start;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 6px;
		}
	}
</style>
